  "summary": {
    "text": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 is the general-availability release of DeepSeek-V4-Pro, rolled out on 2026-08-13 in the DeepSeek app, web chat (Expert Mode) and API under the unchanged name deepseek-v4-pro, with weights under the MIT License. It keeps the preview's model structure and adds a DSpark speculative decoding module; DeepSeek describes much stronger agent capabilities.",
