  "notes": "Announced by DeepSeek as the GA release of DeepSeek-V4-Pro, rolled out on app, web (Expert Mode) and API under the unchanged model name deepseek-v4-pro. The card calls it the official release superseding the preview, built on the preview model structure with a DSpark speculative decoding module attached; no parameter count is restated for it, so parameters are left out. Peak and off-peak API pricing was introduced with it (effective 2026-08-16, 16:00 UTC). The Hugging Face repository was created on 2026-08-13 (hub metadata, not stated on a page)."
